# 2021 day 3: Binary Diagnostic
#
#   puzzle:   d3.md
#   example:  i3 -> o3
#   real:     a3 (swap it in below)
Cursed Energy: a3

Part "1":
    Digit Grid
    Rotate Grid
        Mode: Left
    Convert To Rows
    Map Each
        Using: (xs) -> list(round(tofloat(sum(xs)) / length(xs)), if round(tofloat(sum(xs)) / length(xs)) = 0 then 1 else 0)
    Convert To Grid
    Rotate Grid
        Mode: Right
    Convert To Rows
    Map Each
        Fold
            Seed: ""
            Using: (acc, x) -> textjoin(list(acc, totext(x)), "")
        Apply
            Using: (x) -> frombin(x)
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> first(x) * last(x)
    stdout

Part "2":

    stdout
